# Parsed by Workers static assets, never served itself.
#
# The tracker URL is in every customer's snippet and can't carry a version or
# hash, so it can't be cached for long: one hour lets a fix reach every site
# within an hour, while browsers and Cloudflare still serve most pageviews
# from cache. The default (max-age=0, must-revalidate) would add a
# revalidation request to every pageview of every customer site.
/script.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
